Neon Tides is released under two licences, depending on the kind of file.

1. CODE — MIT License
   Applies to: game.js, market.js, styles.css, index.html (markup and structure),
   tools/*.mjs, and the data structures of cases.js and trade.js.

2. ARTWORK AND STORY — Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
   Applies to: the harbour illustration (the inline SVG in index.html), the portraits
   and favicon in assets/, and all story text in cases.js and trade.js (dialogue, clue
   and rumour wording, scene descriptions, endings, the morning wire), as well as the prose of the documentation files.

If you are unsure which licence applies to a file, treat the text you read on
screen as CC BY 4.0 and the code that shows it as MIT.

